# F-04, F-24: the Courant check works before meshing, from blockMeshDict, and states its working in numbers
open $SB/ws/cavity
click nav:run
wait-until page Run
wait-until text Co ≈ 1.0 timeout 5
wheel 0 text:Co ≈ 1.0
wait 60
screenshot $OUT/courant_tip.png
click dict:system/controlDict:deltaT
enter 0.5
key S ctrl
wait 220
assert text Co ≈ 100
